    mistakes: [['Sub-interfaces down', 'The physical G0/0 needs no shutdown.'], ['Only one VLAN can reach the router', 'Check the trunk allowed list on SW1 G0/2 and the encapsulation number on each sub-interface.'], ['PCs reach the gateway but not each other', 'Check each PC\'s default gateway matches its own VLAN.']],
